  <!-- EN: Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelQuestExpired.slateRef>Missão expirada: [resolvedQuestName]</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelQuestExpired.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The bandit camp has packed up and moved on. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has expired. -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextQuestExpired.slateRef>O acampamento de bandidos levantou arraiais e seguiu caminho. A missão [resolvedQuestName] expirou.</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextQuestExpired.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelQuestFailed.slateRef>Missão falhada: [resolvedQuestName]</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelQuestFailed.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: After being discovered, the bandit camp has dispersed. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has ended. -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextQuestFailed.slateRef>Depois de descoberto, o acampamento de bandidos dispersou-se. A missão [resolvedQuestName] terminou.</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextQuestFailed.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Payment arrived -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelPaymentArrived.slateRef>Pagamento recebido</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterLabelPaymentArrived.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: You have defeated the bandit camp!\n\nThe payment from [asker_faction_name] has arrived. -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextPaymentArrived.slateRef>Derrotaste o acampamento de bandidos!\n\nO pagamento de [asker_faction_name] chegou.</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextPaymentArrived.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] -->
