  <!-- EN: These colonists participated in the victory for the quest [resolvedQuestName]. [asker_definite] wants to know who should receive the [royalFavorReward_amount] [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] for this service. -->
  <OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextFavorReceiver.slateRef>Estes colonos participaram na vitória da missão [resolvedQuestName]. [asker_definite] quer saber quem deve receber [royalFavorReward_amount] de [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] por este serviço.</OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.LetterTextFavorReceiver.slateRef>

